{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18502","headline":"太原和严长官八月十五日夜西山童子上方玩月寄中丞少尹 · 欧阳詹","name":"太原和严长官八月十五日夜西山童子上方玩月寄中丞少尹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"西寺碧云端，东溟白雪团。\n年来一夜玩，君在半天看。\n素魄当怀上，清光在下寒。\n宜裁济江什，有阻惠连欢。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"欧阳詹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18502.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18502","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}